      <h2>Global Market Overview</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">Summarizing total listings per city, overall price distribution, and room-type breakdown to establish scale and composition of each market.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="kpi-grid">
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-label">Total Listings Analyzed</div>
