        <div class="kpi-sub">Across 7 cities</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-label">Largest Market</div>
        <div class="kpi-value">London</div>
        <div class="kpi-sub">16,674 listings (33%)</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-label">Highest Median Price</div>
        <div class="kpi-value">$1,400</div>
        <div class="kpi-sub">Bangkok (vs. $131–$222 range elsewhere)</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-label">Avg. Professional Host Share</div>
        <div class="kpi-value">36%</div>
        <div class="kpi-sub">Hosts with 5+ listings</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="data-note">
      <strong>Data coverage note:</strong> The dataset contains listings for 7 of the 10 cities specified — London, Paris, Sydney, Barcelona, Bangkok, Amsterdam, and Rome. New York, Tokyo, and Los Angeles are absent from this scrape. Price data is fully available for Amsterdam, Bangkok, Barcelona, London, and Rome. Paris and Sydney have <strong>no price data</strong> in this dataset — all price fields are null for both cities. Findings related to pricing apply only to the 5 cities with available data.
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 28px;">
      <table class="data-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>City</th>
            <th class="text-right">Total Listings</th>
            <th class="text-right">Median Price (USD)</th>
            <th class="text-right">Mean Price (USD)</th>
            <th class="text-right">Entire Home (%)</th>
            <th class="text-right">Private Room (%)</th>
            <th class="text-right">Other (%)</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>London</strong></td>
            <td class="text-right">16,674</td>
            <td class="text-right">$135</td>
            <td class="text-right">$210</td>
            <td class="text-right">64.7%</td>
            <td class="text-right">35.0%</td>
            <td class="text-right">0.3%</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Paris</strong></td>
            <td class="text-right">13,927</td>
            <td class="text-right"><span class="no-data">N/A</span></td>
            <td class="text-right"><span class="no-data">N/A</span></td>
            <td class="text-right">88.2%</td>
            <td class="text-right">10.7%</td>
            <td class="text-right">1.1%</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Rome</strong></td>
            <td class="text-right">6,386</td>
            <td class="text-right">$131</td>
            <td class="text-right">$198</td>
            <td class="text-right">74.7%</td>
            <td class="text-right">24.1%</td>
            <td class="text-right">1.1%</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Bangkok</strong></td>
            <td class="text-right">4,961</td>
            <td class="text-right">$1,400</td>
            <td class="text-right">$2,337</td>
            <td class="text-right">65.8%</td>
            <td class="text-right">32.0%</td>
            <td class="text-right">2.1%</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Barcelona</strong></td>
            <td class="text-right">3,269</td>
            <td class="text-right">$132</td>
            <td class="text-right">$190</td>
            <td class="text-right">60.2%</td>
            <td class="text-right">38.9%</td>
            <td class="text-right">0.9%</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Sydney</strong></td>
            <td class="text-right">3,013</td>
            <td class="text-right"><span class="no-data">N/A</span></td>
            <td class="text-right"><span class="no-data">N/A</span></td>
            <td class="text-right">79.0%</td>
            <td class="text-right">20.3%</td>
            <td class="text-right">0.8%</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Amsterdam</strong></td>
            <td class="text-right">1,770</td>
            <td class="text-right">$222</td>
